Yes, duplicate charges are refunded [1], [2]. Atlas detects most duplicate charges within 24 hours
and refunds them automatically, or Support will refund the duplicate as soon as it is reported
[1], [2]. Refunds appear on your card statement within 5 to 10 business days, depending on your
bank, while direct debit refunds take up to 3 business days [1], [2].

